            <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">
                Create professional invoices for your tutoring business in seconds. Add hourly rates, session packages, subject details, student information, and download as PDF. Perfect for private tutors, online teachers, and tutoring centers.
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
                <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4">
                    Create Tutoring Invoice
                </a>

                <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4">
                    Explore Features
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-3 mt-3">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center h-100">
                        <h3 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-1">4.8/5</h3>
                        <p class="mb-0 small text-muted">User Rating</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center h-100">
