                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">Instant PDF Download</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Download high-quality PDF invoices ready to email to parents or print.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Why Tutors Love Our Invoice Generator</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    Running a tutoring business means focusing on teaching, not paperwork. RatPDF helps private tutors, online teachers, and tutoring centers create professional, branded invoices in seconds – for one-on-one sessions, group classes, or packaged lessons.
                </p>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    Our tool is completely free, requires no registration, and generates clean, parent-friendly PDF invoices that include all the details parents need: subject, student name, session date, hours, rate, and payment instructions.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ No monthly fees – 100% free</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Tutor-specific invoice fields</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Subject, student, session details</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Hourly, per-session, or package billing</li>
