                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-4 p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">Ready to Invoice Your Tutoring Student?</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">
                        Create a professional invoice for your tutoring student in under a minute. No signup, no credit card – just fast, free invoices.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold">
                        Create Tutoring Invoice Now
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions for Tutors</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        What should I include on a tutoring invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        A tutoring invoice should include your name/logo, student name (or parent name), subject, session date(s), duration (e.g., 60 min), hourly rate or per-session fee, number of sessions, total hours, any materials fee, tax (if applicable), total due, and payment terms.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this tutoring invoice generator really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes! RatPDF's invoice generator is completely free for tutors. No hidden fees, subscriptions, or watermarks. Create unlimited invoices and download them as PDF files at no cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I bill for tutoring packages (e.g., 5 sessions)?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. Create a line item like "5-session Math tutoring package" with a fixed price. You can also list individual session dates with hours if you prefer per-session billing.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Does it support multiple students or subjects on one invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. Add a separate line item for each student or subject. For example, "Student A – Math (3 hours $50/hr)" and "Student B – English (2 hours  $50/hr)" can appear on the same invoice.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need to create an account to generate invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account or sign-up is required. Start creating invoices immediately – we don't store any of your data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Create Professional Tutoring Invoices in Seconds</h2>
